UPTOSIGN_HIDE_MAIL_AND_PHONETooltip=If you enable this mode, email addresses and phone numbers will be partially masked on the produced documents. In exchange, UPTOSIGN commits to archiving the proof file for 10 years. This option is billed as a surcharge: 1 signature is then billed as 2 signatures. For more details please refer to the <a href="https://doc.cap-rel.fr/projet_uptosign/masquer_partiellement_les_informations_des_signataires">specific documentation</a>.
