UPTOSIGN_DEFAULT_USERTooltip=Links actions to a default user, this key must be set
UPTOSIGN_ADD_DIRECT_SIGN_LOCAL=Add a button to launch the signing process locally
UPTOSIGN_ADD_DIRECT_SIGN_LOCALTooltip=Allows you to launch the signing process directly, for example if you are in presence of your customer (does not send the link by email). Only works for object types supported by Dolibarr core (proposals, interventions, contracts, etc.)
UPTOSIGN_ADD_CONTACT_POSTE_FUNCTION=Add the contact's position/function on the signed PDF along with name
UPTOSIGN_ADD_CONTACT_POSTE_FUNCTIONTooltip=Adds the position/function on the document along with the first and last name of the signer
UPTOSIGN_DISABLE_GETURL_DEBUG=Disable network request debug
UPTOSIGN_EXPERIMENTAL=Experimental zone / Advanced options reserved for adventurers
UPTOSIGN_CREATE_SIGN_CONTACT_ONLINE=Allow the customer to create their signatory contact, <a href="https://doc.cap-rel.fr/projet_uptosign/ajout_du_contact_signataire_par_le_client" target="_blank">documentation</a>
UPTOSIGN_CREATE_SIGN_CONTACT_ONLINETooltip=See the <a href="https://doc.cap-rel.fr/projet_uptosign/ajout_du_contact_signataire_par_le_client" target="_blank">dedicated documentation</a>, this option allows the customer, when viewing the document on your Dolibarr, to provide the signatory's details which will then be sent to uptosign to initiate the formal signature
UPTOSIGN_CREATE_SIGN_ALL_CONTACT_LINKED=Allow any customer contact linked to the document to sign it
UPTOSIGN_CREATE_SIGN_ALL_CONTACT_LINKEDTooltip=No need to assign the "electronic signature" role to a contact... the downside is that a customer's technician could end up signing a proposal... use with full knowledge of the consequences
UPTOSIGN_FORCE_AS_DEFAULT_SIGN_SYSTEM_CLONE=Force UpToSign as the default signing system for cloned objects
UPTOSIGN_FORCE_AS_DEFAULT_SIGN_SYSTEM_CLONETooltip=Only applies when the "Electronic signature" field is not set on the Dolibarr object to be signed (for example if you clone an old proposal)
UPTOSIGN_FORCE_AS_DEFAULT_SIGN_SYSTEM=Force UpToSign as the default signing system for all new objects
UPTOSIGN_FORCE_AS_DEFAULT_SIGN_SYSTEMTooltip=Will apply to all new proposals (or other objects) by pre-filling the "Electronic signature" field
UPTOSIGN_FORCE_FIRST_CONTACT_AS_SIGNER=The contact created with the third party is a signer for everything by default
UPTOSIGN_FORCE_FIRST_CONTACT_AS_SIGNERTooltip=Give all signing rights to the first contact when created during the creation of a new third party
THIRDPARTY_SUGGEST_ALSO_ADDRESS_CREATION=Internal Dolibarr option to automatically create a contact along with a third party
THIRDPARTY_SUGGEST_ALSO_ADDRESS_CREATIONTooltip=If you enable this option you can automatically create a contact at the same time as the third party with the same information
UPTOSIGN_DISABLE_SMS_GLOBAL_SELECT=Choice of two-factor authentication code delivery method (default SMS)
UPTOSIGN_DISABLE_SMS_GLOBALTooltip=Warning, the signature value is reduced if you choose anything other than SMS, this option is <b>not recommended</b> (simple signature, by SMS = enhanced signature)
UPTOSIGN_DISABLE_SMS_SELECT_THIRDPART=Choose which third parties have a custom code delivery method
UPTOSIGN_DISABLE_SMS_SELECT_THIRDPARTTooltip=Enable this option if you want to specify which third parties do not receive the code by SMS; it will be sent by email instead which weakens the official value of the signature (single communication channel).
